# FOX One

> FOX One is FOX's direct-to-consumer streaming service for live sports, news, entertainment, and on-demand programming. This file provides a curated index of authoritative FOX One resources covering content, sports, networks, and support. Programming and event availability are subject to change.

## Main Pages

- [Official Homepage](https://www.fox.com/): Official FOX One streaming homepage.
- [Shows and Movies](https://www.fox.com/shows-movies): Browse FOX shows and movies programming.

